---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Silence is refusal made visible" currentPath="/manifesto/foundations/silence">

  <article class="principle-document">
    <header class="principle-header">
      <div class="principle-meta">
        <span>I.4</span>
        <span>E01-P05</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Silence is refusal made visible</h1>
      <p class="abstract">Silence reveals what a system has chosen not to include, without explanation.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="principle-content">
      <h2>Statement</h2>
      <p>Silence communicates refusal without argument.</p>

      <h2>Context</h2>
      <p>Most systems feel compelled to fill space — to justify, to convince, to market. Silence is the opposite: the deliberate choice not to speak, not to include, not to explain.</p>
      <p>This is not absence through neglect. It is absence through intention. What is left unsaid becomes as meaningful as what is spoken.</p>

      <h2>Application</h2>
      <p>Silence manifests in what you refuse to build. No social proof. No testimonials. No urgency mechanics. The absence is deliberate, and that deliberation communicates values more clearly than any statement could.</p>
      <p>Users encounter the silence and understand: this system has priorities, and those priorities exclude certain common practices. The refusal is the message.</p>

      <h2>Citation</h2>
      <p class="citation-text">This principle may be cited as: <strong>I.4 (Silence)</strong> or by plate reference <strong>E01-P05</strong>.</p>
    </section>
  </article>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .principle-document {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .principle-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 37, 0.15);
  }

  .principle-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.45;
  }

  .principle-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .abstract {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .principle-content h2 {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .principle-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .citation-text {
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-style: normal;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .citation-text strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
    opacity: 1;
  }
</style>